STRING 59
{
|c0000cdf9Wintermaul Tower Defense v1.1

-You select an element at your element chooser, the elements all have their strengths and weaknesses, so pick one that suits your playing style.
-Once you have selected your element, build the worker at your element building
-Attackers come from the top three places at the top of the map. You must keep them from reaching the bottom where the ship is by building towers.
-If the attacker on level 30 boards the ship, you lose.
-The "Sell" function is ON the towers, not a command you type in.
-Good Luck!!!|r
}

STRING 60
{
|c0000cdf9For help on how to play type... -help
To see the HUGE amount of updates press F9|r
}

STRING 61
{
|c0000cdf9Next level in 30 seconds|r
}

