STRING 94
{
Wintermaul X13 Ultimate Version
Double starting money. Added 4 spawn locations, more races, more levels (up to 50)  and new towers. (dukewintermaul)
Added Demonic Race and Heaven Race. 
Replaced Poison with Space.
dukewintermaul made weaker. (dukewintermaul)
Have Fun!
Many thanks to bloodyspear, matteo77,  bobby1234 and of course me (dukewintermaul) for testing and helping out.

}

