STRING 524
{
1.1 Updates
}

STRING 525
{
|c0000cdf9-Difficulty settings added
-Pathing system tweaked
-Chain Lightning Caster cooldown increased from 1 second to 2 seconds
-Removed splash on Nuclear Missile Silo, tweaked attack animation, and decreased cooldown from 10 seconds to 6 seconds
-Laser Cannon's price increased to 750 from 500, damage reduced to 250 from 500
-Battery damage reduced to 150-200 from 400-450, attack art fixed
-Thunder Rod cooldown increased to 2 seconds from .85 seconds
-Envenomed Spike cooldown increased to 1.25 seconds from .90 seconds
-Enhanced Arrow Tower and Sniper Post range increased by 100
-Levels 10 and 20 have 25% less hit points
-Attackers on level 10 and 20 move more slowly
-Level 20 has 5 less armor
-Levels 1-9 have 50% more hit points
-Levels 11-15 have 25% more hit points|r
}

